<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Special Date Planner</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600&family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6fa 0%, #e0c3fc 50%, #8ec5fc 100%);
      padding: 20px;
      color: #4a3e3d;
    }
    .card {
      width: min(480px, 100%);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(147, 112, 219, 0.25);
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px) scale(0.98); } to { opacity:1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
    .emoji-hero { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block; animation: bounce 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes bounce { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);} 50%{transform:translateY(-10px);} }
    h1,h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color:#6a1b9a; margin-bottom:15px; line-height:1.3; }
    p { color:#666; font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:20px; }
    .btn-group { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; margin-top:20px; }
    .btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7eb3, #ff758c);
      color: white; border: none; border-radius: 20px; padding: 14px 22px; font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition:all .2s ease; box-shadow:0 8px 15px rgba(255,117,140,0.3); display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02); box-shadow:0 12px 20px rgba(255,117,140,0.4); }
    .btn-alt { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd, #c2e9fb); color:#2c3e50; box-shadow:0 8px 15px rgba(161,196,253,0.3); }
    .calendar-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(7, 1fr); gap:8px; margin:20px 0; }
    .calendar-day {
      padding:12px 5px; background:#f8f0fc; border-radius:12px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600; transition:.2s; border:1px solid #e1bee7;
    }
    .calendar-day:hover, .calendar-day.selected { background:#ab47bc; color:white; transform:scale(1.08); }
    .slide-btn {
      background:#8e24aa; color:white; padding:16px 28px; border-radius:50px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; margin-top:20px; box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(142,36,170,0.3); transition:.3s;
    }
    .slide-btn:hover { letter-spacing:1px; background:#7b1fa2; }
    .ride-illustration {
      width:100%; height:180px; background:#f3e5f5; border-radius:20px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:20px 0; border:2px dashed #ba68c8;
    }
    .summary-box {
      background:#f3e5f5; padding:18px; border-radius:20px; text-align:left; font-size:0.95rem; margin-top:15px; line-height:1.6; border:1px solid #ce93d8;
    }
    .summary-box li { margin-bottom:8px; list-style:none; }
    .status { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #6a1b9a; font-weight: 600; }
    .status.error { color: #b00020; }
    .tiny { font-size: 0.78rem; color:#7c7c7c; margin-top:10px; }
    .name-field {
      width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #d9bce6; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card" id="step-1">
    <div class="emoji-hero">👭💕✨</div>
    <h1>Can we go on a date?</h1>
    <p>I planned something super special for us! 🌸</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="nextStep(2)">Yes! 💖</button>
      <button class="btn btn-alt" onclick="nextStep(2)">Sure! 🌸</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-2">
    <div class="emoji-hero">📅✨</div>
    <h2>When will you be free?</h2>
    <p>Select a date for this month:</p>
    <div class="calendar-grid" id="calendar"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-3">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🎀🎈</div>
    <h2>Pick our date vibe!</h2>
    <p>Which one are you feeling? 👇</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('activity', 'Beach Date + Complimentary Photos 🏖️📸'); nextStep(4);">1) Beach Date & Complimentary Photos 🏖️📸</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('activity', 'Movie Date + Mall Visit 🍿🛍️'); nextStep(4);">2) Movie Date & Mall Visit 🍿🛍️</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('activity', 'Metro Water Ride + Sightseeing 🌊🏙️'); nextStep(4);">3) Metro Water Ride & Sightseeing 🌊🏙️</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('activity', 'Lulu Mall + Church Visit 🛍️⛪'); nextStep(4);">4) Lulu Mall & Church Visit 🛍️⛪</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-4">
    <div class="emoji-hero">👑✨💅</div>
    <h2>Amazing choice my bossu lady!</h2>
    <p>Click below to continue planning... 💕</p>
    <div class="slide-btn" onclick="nextStep(5)">Slide to Next ➔</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-5">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🚀🛵</div>
    <h2>How will we go to the destination?</h2>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('ride', 'Metro 🚇'); nextStep(6);">1) Metro 🚇</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('ride', 'Bus 🚌'); nextStep(6);">2) Bus 🚌</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('ride', 'Scooter 🛵'); nextStep(6);">3) Scooter 🛵</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-6">
    <div class="emoji-hero">👧✨👧</div>
    <h2>Off We Go! 🎉</h2>
    <div class="ride-illustration">
      <div style="font-size: 3.5rem;" id="ride-icon">🛵</div>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #7b1fa2;" id="ride-text">Two anime girls riding together!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="slide-btn" onclick="nextStep(7)">Next Slide ➔</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-7">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🥐🥞☕</div>
    <h2>What will you prefer for Breakfast?</h2>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('breakfast', 'Indian Breakfast (Your Choice) 🍲'); nextStep(8);">1) Indian Breakfast (Your Choice) 🍲</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('breakfast', 'Non-Veg Breakfast 🍗'); nextStep(8);">2) Non-Veg Breakfast 🍗</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('breakfast', 'Vegetarian Breakfast 🥗'); nextStep(8);">3) Vegetarian Breakfast 🥗</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-8">
    <div class="emoji-hero">📝☕💖</div>
    <h2>Taking notes girl... ✍️</h2>
    <p>Do we supposed to have tea right? I also noted that for you! 😉☕✨</p>
    <div class="slide-btn" onclick="nextStep(9)">Continue ➔</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-9">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🍱😋</div>
    <h2>What's the plan for Lunch?</h2>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('lunch', 'Meals Veg 🥗'); nextStep(10);">1) Veg Meals 🥗</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('lunch', 'Meals Non-Veg 🐟'); nextStep(10);">2) Non-Veg Meals 🐟</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('lunch', 'Chicken / Beef Biryani 🍲'); nextStep(10);">3) Chicken / Beef Biryani 🍲</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('lunch', 'Anything of your choice ✨'); nextStep(10);">4) Anything of your choice ✨</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-10">
    <div class="emoji-hero">👑🌸✨</div>
    <h2>Always your choice my princess! 💖</h2>
    <p>Let's lock in the rest of the day!</p>
    <div class="slide-btn" onclick="nextStep(11)">Slide to Next ➔</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-11">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🧋🍰</div>
    <h2>Would you like evening tea & snacks?</h2>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" onclick="selectOption('snacks', 'Yes, absolutely! 🍰☕'); nextStep(12);">YES! 🍰☕</button>
      <button class="btn btn-alt" onclick="selectOption('snacks', 'No, I am good! 🌸'); nextStep(12);">NO 🌸</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card hidden" id="step-12">
    <div class="emoji-hero">🥰🎉✨🥳</div>
    <h2>Your saraassu is waiting for the date my janu..... 💖✨</h2>
    <p>Here is our complete date plan!</p>

    <input id="personName" class="name-field" type="text" placeholder="Your name (optional)" />

    <div class="summary-box">
      <ul id="final-summary"></ul>
    </div>

    <button class="btn" id="save-response-btn" style="margin-top: 18px; width: 100%;">Send my reply 💖</button>
    <div id="status" class="status"></div>
    <div class="tiny">Invite link: <span id="share-link"></span></div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
  <script src="./config.js"></script>
  <script src="./app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
